{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S03、S08、S11、S12等短停留段落的信息密度偏高，即使感受词较小且部分按音乐时点出现，仍可能让观众来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏更容易快速扫读，但右侧感受词容易变成一组需要自行拼接的印象，人物心理和音乐变化之间的关系不够清楚。Y通过重点词突出、话与感受交替以及随音乐出现的细节，让人更容易理解他为什么既舍不得亲近又不愿回去忍受委屈，也更清楚地感受到从怀念、挣扎、孤独到重新站稳的完整变化。Y的感受描写明显更细腻具体，因此综合体验更好，代价是局部阅读负担较重。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7fda6951-89a3-4497-b88a-0f0a7834ebf7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T232603554479Z", "elapsed_seconds": 61.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:27:05.534170+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7d7137eb3cd27220780d655bbfaf172cd4c37e5a127231fce35a5718d73931d8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\